WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.440
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.780
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.410
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.910
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.150
At sunset,

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:58.490
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.580
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.370
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:10.000
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.720
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.140
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.430
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:24.930
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.740
Pleased to meet you.

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:42.370
Indeed. You do look like her.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:50.080
I'm Kurata Sana, eleven years old.
I'm a 6th grader and TV personality.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.380
Sagami Rei-kun. He's my
chauffeur and manager,

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.050
and used to be my boyfriend.
He's pretty shrewd.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.380
Hayama Akito, someone who
I've become good friends with,

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:58.090
after a lot of wrangling.

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:01.680
Lately, when he is by my side,
I feel somewhat relaxed.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.640
And this is Mama. My beloved Mama.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:12.400
"The Daughter Cries,
and the Mother Cries, Too"

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:17.450
Still, I wonder if you have any more
conclusive evidence that you could offer,

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.780
that you are her mother.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.790
The girl that I gave birth to

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.290
had three moles lined up
in a row on her rear end.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:36.090
My real mother has been found...
My real, birth mother...

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:43.100
Still, it's Mama's feelings
that I'm concerned about.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.730
"Mama vs. Mother"

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.750
Sakai... Keiko-san...

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.080
Yes.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.540
25 years old.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.750
That would mean that you were 14
when you had Sana, huh?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.090
Yes.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:23.760
But, since you were young, you could
be forgiven for abandoning your baby.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.770
You do realize that that
just isn't so, right?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.430
Yes.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.180
You raise the child you bear.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.020
Why is it that dogs and cats,
and even chipmunks can understand that,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.650
and yet there are people who can't?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.190
Stand up.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.710
Sensei...

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.710
Sensei...!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.720
I'm satisfied. I'll let
Sana handle the rest.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.720
Huh? You're satisfied...?

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.060
Sensei...

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.720
Sensei...!

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.060
Sensei, I brought Sana with me.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:19.070
Oh? Thank you, but why
is Hayama-kun with her?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.530
I asked him if he wouldn't
mind staying behind myself,

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.070
--but Sana-chan said that
--Hey! What did you do that for, Hayama!?

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.580
--when Hayama-kun is around,
--You perve!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.410
--she can be her usual self, so...
--How can I ever trust you!?

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.700
--Well, okay.
--Take this!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.370
Sana...

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.370
--'lo.
--You're looking well.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:38.040
Yeah, thankfully!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:43.510
She says her name is Sakai Keiko-san.
She knew about your three stars.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.720
Talk to her.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.050
Huh? What about you, Mama?

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:49.390
I'm done with her.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.310
Mama...

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.120
Whoa! We have the same face!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.920
Well hello there! I'm Sana!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.590
So, please sit down.
Remember, it's long been said,

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.090
"Clothing is worn by
the sitting household."

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.420
It's "Fortune comes to
the happy household."

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.090
"There are sitting fools,
and there are fools who watch."

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.430
What's the big idea,
treating us like fools?

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.090
"Sitting takes three years,
persimmons eight."

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.430
That doesn't even make sense!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.100
Shimura-san, could we have some tea?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.470
--Oh, right, this is
my good friend, Hayama.
--Tea? All right.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.390
--And hey, how come you guys
have all fallen flat?
--It's your fault, you know.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.690
Oh, Rei-kun, did you fall flat, too?
Oh, Shimura-san, some chestnut buns, too.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.360
--Chestnut buns! Chestnut buns! Yay!
--Oh, right. --Calm clown.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.690
Fourteen...

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:48.030
Yeah? You had me when you were 14!?
Amazing! Let's see, 14...

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.370
I'll be 14 in another
two and a half years.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.370
Wow, what a surprise, right?
Surprising, surprising, right?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.540
I could also say it's astounding. 14, huh?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.710
You probably would abandon your baby.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.380
Uh-huh! Abandon her, abandon her!

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.050
Please don't worry about it.
On the contrary,

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.720
I feel lucky to have been abandoned.
I really love the life I'm living now.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.720
She's always like this, so there's
no need to take her too seriously.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.390
What are you saying!?

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.140
--You idiot! Watch it with that thing!
--You sure are acting like a big shot!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.390
--See? She's weird, huh? Weird, isn't she?
--Can I get another cup?
--Yes, yes, right away.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.060
The birth mother is at a loss.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.730
We're at a loss, too.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:24.570
So anyway, Keiko-san, what kind of person
was my father? Is he alive? Is he dead?

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.740
Um, he passed away four years ago.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.030
Oh, my dad is dead.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:38.000
In my family, there was
just me and my mother.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:43.040
My mother got herself a boyfriend,
and hardly ever came home.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.380
Every day was hard for me.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:52.680
I was still just a child,
but I truly did love him.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:58.230
But, I just couldn't tell him
that we were having a baby...

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.020
Was that baby me?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.190
Right.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.360
How come you didn't decide
not to give birth?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.900
Don't say it like it's nothing!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:13.370
I just... couldn't think about anything...
I couldn't tell anyone...

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.740
Oh, then, you had her all by yourself?

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:16.740
Yes.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:21.710
I was so confused... I didn't
even realize what had happened.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:26.750
I didn't know... what I should do...

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.260
Oh, it's okay, it's okay,
it's all in the past.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.680
I couldn't really get a handle on it,
no matter what you told me, anyhow.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.130
Right? Right?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:37.850
Never mind that, there's something that
I've been really wanting to ask you.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:43.020
I wanted to know...

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.980
...when is my birthday?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:51.700
Don't you have anything
more important to ask?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:56.370
Huh!? This is important! Up to now,
it has always been the 7th of March.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.240
"Sana-chan sings"

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.290
Huh? You're going to sing?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.370
♪ March 7th is Sana-chan's birthday! ♪

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.380
♪ That's the day that Mama found me. ♪

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.380
♪ March 7th! March 7th! ♪

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.710
♪ Hey, hey, from what the doctor said, ♪

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.720
♪ I'm pretty sure this little baby... ♪

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.720
♪ ...was just born today,
this pretty baby. ♪

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.720
♪ That's where Mama got my name from. ♪

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.720
♪ SAngatsu NAnoka, Sa-Na, San-Na, Sa-Na
("March") ("7th") ♪

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.720
♪ Sana Sana Sana Sana,
Kurata Sana! Yeah! ♪

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:22.560
♪ March 7th, so Kurata Sa-Na! ♪

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.560
"Kurata Sana"

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.060
Oh, I get it. So that's
where it's from, huh?

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.400
So, what of it?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.400
Don't you get it yet?
What if they were wrong?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.650
What if I was actually
born on March 6th?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.320
I'd be Kurata Sa-Mu, right?

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.320
Yeah, "Samu."

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.320
Oh, I get it. "Sam."

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:40.490
Hi! My name is Sam.
Very thank you. And you?

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:40.490
"Hayama's image of Sam"

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:44.000
Huh? Hayama liked that one!
What, was that funny?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.000
You like "Sam"? Is it that funny?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.500
Oh, sorry. It's just so rare
for this boy to laugh.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.500
This could be the first time.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.670
Even more rare than a fish
with a human face.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.380
I'd better take a picture
before I forget!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.020
"My name is Sam!
Sam speak English very well."

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.680
"Sam like a natto.
It's sticky and yummy!"

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:04.350
Cut it out!

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.350
--You laughed!
--Stop!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.690
Ah, what are you doing!?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.360
Hey, hey, hey! "Tempura and salted fish
are also wonderful!"

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:13.860
I mustn't laugh...
I'm in no position to laugh...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.830
--"My friend is Tom."
--She is trying not to laugh.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.370
--"Tom is taller than him."
--She's not at all serious.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.370
--Stop!
--I'm not so sure about this.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.040
It's okay, isn't it?

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.050
Um, it was March 7th,
no doubt about it.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.670
Really!? Thank goodness! I am Sana!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.680
Is he worn out from laughing?
He's gone limp.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:40.010
Keiko-san, you have a ring.
You're married.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:40.680
Yes.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.350
A ring worn on the left ring finger
is a wedding ring.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.350
So, do you have any children?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.690
Yes, I do. I'm sorry.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.690
What are you apologizing for?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:53.070
As long as you're happy, that's great.
So, how old are your children?

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.030
Boys? Girls?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.700
I have a daughter... who is almost 3.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:01.620
Wow! I have a younger sister!
Hayama, did you hear?

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.040
I have a younger sister!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.040
You're happy about that? Good for you.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:10.040
You think of her... as your sister?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.670
Huh? Well, she is, right?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:28.480
Sensei...

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.320
She said she was going home for the day.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.650
I see.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:38.530
Sana-chan has made plans
to see her again on Sunday.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:44.450
She said she has a daughter...
and Sana-chan...

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.870
wants to meet her sister.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.170
Is that all right?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.260
Okay, see you Sunday at Ribbonland!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:07.520
I'll leave that up to Sana.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.360
What? From this distance,
you can tell me directly.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:21.360
Hayama, would you come along
with us on Sunday, too?

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:24.030
Y- yeah...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.660
Can Tsuyoshi come, too?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:31.370
He's been terribly worried about you.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.000
Hey, how is Sana-chan doing!?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.710
What's going on!?
Akito-kun, do you know anything!?

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:37.710
You know something, don't you!? Spill it!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.720
It's hard not telling him anything.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.050
Oh, I see...

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.390
Mm-hmm, sure! Tsuyoshi-kun too.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.050
Babbit-byunnn!

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:49.600
"Misako-san power-napping.
DO NOT WAKE!!"

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:49.600
Do not wake me. I'm asleep!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:54.400
Mama has been keeping to
her room this whole time.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:57.520
She wouldn't be avoiding me, would she?

00:11:58.730 --> 00:11:59.940
Mama...

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.340
And so, the day she met her sister...

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.340
Oh, you guys!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.680
Yes?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.350
I have the press after me, you see,

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:31.350
"I am not Sana-chan"

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.350
so I wore a disguise!

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.350
It's a little obvious, Sana-chan.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:45.950
"I am nawt Zenjiro"

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.980
Ah, my back hoits...
ah, my back hoits...

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.940
It's perfect, Zenjiro-sensei.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.360
Isn't it though, Uchiyamada? Aftuh awl,

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.320
I am being puhsued by
entuhtainrnent reportuhs.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:43.990
I tried to flee to Awstralia, but to
my suhprise, I didn't have any savings.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.950
That's why you came over
to my house, right?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:48.280
You know, though, there aren't
any reportuhs around.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:52.790
"What are you doing here!?"

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.330
Maybe they're not following you anymore.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.790
Nawnsense, how could that be?

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.960
This week's Sana-chan. Take it easy
on the disguises, though.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:00.340
It just doesn't seem
like enough, somehow.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.300
Say, Sana-chan, where are you
meeting your sister, by the way?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.680
Huh? Mariko-chan?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.680
Her name is Mariko-chan, huh?

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:10.010
She says she always watches me on TV,
and that she's a fan of mine.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.020
Hey...

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.980
Mama, this way, this way!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:15.980
Ah, there they are.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.650
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.360
Okay!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.320
All right, now for my meet-by-accident-
and-become-friends strategy.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.320
Sana-chan, you're walking kind of stiff.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.700
You guys are walking weird, too.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:30.870
Ah! A Fewwis wheel! Over there!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.620
How completely deliberate-looking!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.290
Mama, she dwopped something!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.290
You're right. Pick it up for her.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.290
...come on... pick it up...
come... on...

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.300
Tell her "you dropped this."

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.300
You dwopped this!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:50.640
Whoops! Oh, no! You're right! I dropped
my ticket! Castella! Kakkurakin!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.640
Thank you.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.310
Sana-chan? From TV?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.650
That's right, Sana-chan!
I'm here to have a good time today.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:01.980
To thank you for picking that up,

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.650
how about today you have
some fun together with Sana-chan?

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.650
--Wow! Sana-chan! Sana-chan!
--Looks like it worked out okay.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.530
Oh, shh, okay? I'm undercover today.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:10.450
Undercover?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.450
"Wet's pway with Sana-chan"

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.660
Wow, we're spinning, we're spinning!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.330
Wow, I'm getting dizzy!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.670
I'm fine!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.330
Um...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.340
Whew, this is fun, huh, Akito-kun?

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.380
Not really.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.010
Okay, Mariko-chan, right, right!
Ah, left!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.340
Which way, which way!?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.680
--Come on, come on, this way, this way!
Oh, wrong, that way!
--Akito-kun, Akito-kun, isn't this fun!?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.680
Yeah.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.600
Look, we're so high!
Everyone looks so small, huh?

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.270
They wook wike dolls!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:37.940
Hey, Hayama!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.270
Let's go on it, okay, Akito-kun?
Let's go on it!

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:41.270
No.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.610
Mariko-chan, you know what?

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.610
Hayama is a wimp!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.950
She sure told you, Akito-kun!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.610
Waugh! I won't say it again!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.950
Wimp!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.280
Mawiko isn't scared.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.620
Terrific, Mariko-chan!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.620
--Sana-chan, is this Cindewewwa?
--Hi-ho! Akito-kun, having fun?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.950
--It's the pumpkin coach!
--No.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:00.960
--Mawiko-chan knows about Cindewewwa.
I wead about her in a book.
--How cute! This little girl is my sister!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.630
--Oh, yeah? Mariko-chan,
you can read books?
--However, I'm sure that what I'm feeling

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:08.300
--Mm-mm, Mama weads it to me.
--isn't the way it feels
to be an older sister.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.300
--Yay, Sana-chan! Yay, Sana-chan!
--Maybe I'm just simply
a kid who likes kids.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:12.970
Here we go, Komawari spin!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.310
Akito-kun! Akito-kun! Isn't this fun!?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.970
Not one bit.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.140
And, sure enough...

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.860
sure enough...

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.320
Uh-oh, she's nodding off. Is she tired?

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.320
Yes.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.320
What do you say we bring this to a close?

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.620
All right.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:39.120
Keiko-san, thank you. I'm glad
I got to meet Mariko-chan.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.960
Well then...

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.630
Yo, my friends! Let's go home!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:48.300
Yeah.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.630
Sana-chan...

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:55.640
I'm... in no position to say this,

00:15:55.970 --> 00:16:00.980
but... I wonder if I can
hold out any hope...

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.480
If I shouldn't think
that at some point...

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.980
the day will come that you
will live with us, Sana-chan...?

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.990
That...

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:15.950
...isn't going to happen.
I can't do that.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:22.460
I could never think
of you as my mother.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:26.210
To be frank, I don't feel the
least bit of concern towards you.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.000
You and I...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.300
...will not be seeing each other again.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:37.050
However, there is one thing...

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.930
...that really scares me
whenever I think about it.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.690
There is one thing, ma'am.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:51.280
When I think about...
what if you hadn't given birth to me,

00:16:53.280 --> 00:17:01.250
it really frightens me. After all,
if you hadn't... I wouldn't...

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.080
...be here now.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:15.300
If you hadn't, I would have
never met Mama... or Rei-kun...

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.800
or Hayama and Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:25.640
...and when I think about how I would
have never known this delightful world...

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:32.690
...the thought of it...
is just too sad... and so...

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.200
H- huh...?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:46.870
I am... very grateful to you...
for giving birth to me. And for that...

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.630
I thank you.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:08.940
Zoom!

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:12.980
I'm home!

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.990
Welcome back, Sana-chan! H- how was it!?

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.280
Oh, the press was no problem.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:20.660
No, not that...

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.990
Ah, Zenjiro-san and
Uchiyamada-kun were there.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.700
Oh, really? Not that...

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.000
Mama! I'm home!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.670
Welcome back.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:33.340
Keiko-san asked me if I would
ever come live with her.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.920
She what!? That's outrageous!
So, what happened!?

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.590
Shut up, ex-pimp!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:41.220
What happened?
I turned her down, of course.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:45.930
Mama is the only Mama for me.
I'm never seeing Keiko-san again.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.350
Thank goodness!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.960
Sana...

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.310
I'm so sorry.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.560
It must have been rough, huh?

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.070
I knew when I did it
that it would be cruel...

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:48.450
to tell you everything...
while you were so little...

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.580
I've... been anxious, this whole time...

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:59.920
...thinking that maybe, someday,
your real mother would show up,

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:03.590
and take you away from me.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.600
And so, I wanted to
meet your mother first,

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.140
and show her flat-out...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.270
...that Sana...

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.020
...that Sana was my daughter.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.230
Mama...

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.280
Mama has been worried, too...?

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:30.950
Mama, I can stay here
from now on, right?

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.460
Of course you can!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:03.280
That night, I slept together with Mama.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:07.490
Mama... Mama, I love you.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.710
♪ Sora, sora, sora,
dance of the Maro-chans! ♪

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.510
S- Shenshei, Shenshei, what ish dat?

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:27.510
It's a Maro-chan line dance
that I've been saving.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.510
This isn't Maro-chan's house,
or anything of the sort.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:33.520
Sagami, you don't
have any underpants on.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.270
Oh, shank goodnesh I am wearing dem...

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:40.860
Shenshei, pleashe shtop!
All de wallsh are getting dented!

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.530
Shall we rebuild, then?

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:44.190
It'sh all sho eashy for you...

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:46.950
Let's do it, Mama! Once the royalties
from "My Daughter and I" come in,

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.200
let's rebuild the house!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.200
Mama, to the foyer!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.660
All right!

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.210
Ah, I wrecked the door!

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.870
Fine, whatever...

00:21:56.870 --> 00:22:00.210
There has been an outbreak
of in-house traffic accidents!

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:01.210
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.880
Sana-chan, do you have anything
to say about your mother's book?

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:09.220
What do you mean? That's old news!
You know what? It's already been settled!

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:10.550
Keep up the good work, now!

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:11.850
You're such a grown-up, after all...

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:13.850
Nice work, everyone!

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:16.180
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:18.850
Hey, you two! A good morning, isn't it!?

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:20.190
Yo.

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:21.400
What's the matter, Hayama?

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:22.520
You've got that utsubo na namako look!
("eel-sea cucumber")

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:23.860
That's utsuro na manako!
("blank look in your eyes")

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:26.530
In the end, I didn't do anything.

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:28.860
Oh, why not? You stayed with me
the whole time, didn't you?

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.200
"Oh, Sam is very, very happy!"

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.540
Ah, Akito-kun is laughing!

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:34.870
"Sam thank you very much!"

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:35.540
Stop!

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:36.870
Akito-kun is laughing!

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.210
"Sam have a pen! Something one!"

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:40.790
Akito-kun is laughing!

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:19.160
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.880
he's there.

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.760
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.260
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.480
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.330
...for two.

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:11.050
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:11.050 --> 00:24:12.510
Here's a sudden question--

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:14.680
what is the plate number
on the car that Rei-kun drives?

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.760
What was the only line
that Zenjiro-san said

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.970
when he played the policeman
in that drama?

00:24:18.970 --> 00:24:22.020
What is the name of that white bat
who is always butting in?

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:26.310
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 20;
a summer vacation special!

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:30.990
Feeling Good With a Sana-chan Quiz!

00:24:31.030 --> 00:24:33.030
Looking to win,
Sana-chan will compete, too!

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:36.450
Babbit will be hosting!
I'm a little nervous about it!
